### Summary of Change
AMER DFS Infrastructure Migration to Windows Server 2022.

### Change Summary
Replace four existing DFS servers with four new Windows Server 2022 servers across Orangeburg and Ridge Road data centers. Preserve the existing DFS namespace `\\peoplesoft.bloomberg.com\admin-dfs`, replication group `ADMIN-DFS`, and AdminTools and Packages shares.

### Business Justification
Modernize the DFS infrastructure, replace aging servers, improve resiliency, and maintain high availability across both data centers while preserving existing user access and functionality.

### Expected Impact
Minimal user impact anticipated. Existing DFS paths and drive mappings will remain unchanged. A controlled cutover will be performed after replication synchronization and validation. Brief SMB reconnections may occur.

### Rollout Plan
1. Provision four Windows Server 2022 servers and install DFS Namespace, DFS Replication, and File Server roles.
2. Pre-seed AdminTools and Packages data, preserving permissions.
3. Add new servers to the existing DFS replication group and validate synchronization.
4. Add new namespace servers and folder targets.
5. Transition DFS referrals to the new servers and validate access.
6. Retain legacy servers for rollback and decommission after stabilization.

### Rollback Plan
1. Suspend migration activities and restrict writes if data consistency is uncertain.
2. Verify and reconcile any changes made to the new servers.
3. Re-enable legacy DFS folder targets and disable new target referrals.
4. Validate replication, file access, and application functionality on the original servers.
5. Resume normal operations after stakeholder confirmation.

### Validation Plan
1. Confirm DFS namespace and existing UNC paths remain accessible.
2. Verify AdminTools and Packages data, permissions, and replication health.
3. Confirm all four new servers are functioning as DFS namespace and replication members.
4. Validate client access and DFS referrals from both data centers.
5. Perform controlled failover testing and obtain application owner sign-off.
